{
  "slug": "deep-value",
  "name": "Deep Value",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Professional financial analysis tools for the Israeli stock market (TASE).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `analyze-announcements` (Analyze a company's Maya (TASE) regulatory announcements with materiality scoring), `analyze-orders` (Analyze order flow patterns, compare to prior periods, and assess revenue impact for Israeli public companies), `analyze-report` (Deep-dive analysis of a company's latest financial report with QoQ/YoY trends), `build-thesis` (Build a comprehensive Hebrew investment thesis for an Israeli public company), `compare-companies` (Side-by-side comparison of two Israeli public companies with scoring), `deep-value-methodology`, `hebrew-quality` (Hebrew language quality, grammar, formatting, financial terminology, and self-review checklist for all Hebrew output), `monitor-watchlist` (Generate a personalized Hebrew morning brief for watchlist companies with market snapshot, announcements, alerts, and valuation ranking), and 1 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `deepvalue`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install deep-value@claude-community` from `deepvalueinvesting/deep-value-tase-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
